'''Kumanchu Royale''' (クマんちゅ ロワイアル, ''Kumanchu Rowaiaru'', '''Kumanchu Royale'''), also known by the unofficial name of '''Battle Bears''', was a sequel to the [[Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou|original mobile phone version]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. Developed by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] and only available on older generations of mobile phones, the game was discontinued on January 6th, 2015.

