==Overview==
Kumanchu Royale was a tower defense game about a variety of [[Teacher Bear|bears]] advancing through the world and defeating enemies. The game played exactly the same as its prequel, [[Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou]].

Some enemies from Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou reappeared in this game alongside new, never-before-seen enemies.

