===Enemy Units===
There were 21 [[Enemy Units]] in Kumanchu Royale. Like in the [[Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou|original mobile phone version]], there were only 2 enemy types: [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] and [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]. Some of these enemies were brought straight from The Battle Cats, while others were exclusive to this game; two such enemies, Sleipnir and Mr. Mer, were reimported to The Battle Cats at later dates. Notably, another three enemies (Arabian Nyaight, Fighting Cow and Eminent Inca) were cats much akin to the ones in The Battle Cats.
