==How to play==
===OpenDoja===
:''Note: This method only works for PC/Desktop systems.''
#Download and install Java from [https://www.java.com/en/download/manual.jsp the official website]. Java must be version 22 or above for OpenDoja to run.
#Download the most up to date version of [https://github.com/GrenderG/openDoJa/releases/download/nightly/opendoja-nightly.jar Nightly] as well as the latest stable version of [https://github.com/GrenderG/openDoJa/releases/latest OpenDoja].
#Download the Kumanchu Royale files from [https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/kxv6qbj4dcj3neq8wedm0/AEm3nr7einfQAzBGVYbqmEE?rlkey=8ip9rghdxfapnxphbm413adnx&st=wij4a0wt&e=2&dl=0 here].
#In the address bar where the Kumanchu Royale and OpenDoja files are, input this command "java -jar opendoja-release.jar".
##Alternatively, to skip step 5, input the command "java -jar opendoja-release.jar --run-jam maybe_patched.jam"
#Drag the Kumanchu Royale.jam file into the new window that pops up.
##This step is skipped if you did step just below step 4.
#Now you will be playing Kumanchu Royale, if the screen is too small, right-click and select the size comfortable for you.

===Keitai World Launcher===
#Download and install [https://keitaiarchive.org/ Keitai World Launcher].
#Select "Appli" option.
#Search "Kumanchu Royale".
#Download the game.
#Now you will be playing Kumanchu Royale, if the screen is too small, right click and select the size comfortable for you.

